//
//   id        unique slug
//   title     book title
//   author    author(s)
//   year      first publication (or the edition you'd cite)
//   leaders   leader ids this book covers  → shows in their "Reading" section
//   tags      concept keys this book illuminates → shows on those concepts
//   note      WHY THIS BOOK MATTERS — editorial context (what it's known for,
//             whether it's contested). This is the seeded description.
//
// Your own fields are added in the app and stored separately:
//   shelf     "" | toread | reading | read | reference
//   rating    0–5
//   takeaway  THE ONE THING THIS BOOK TAUGHT YOU — your line, not mine
//   notes     longer personal notes
//
// The seeded `note` and your `takeaway` are shown differently in the
// UI: the note is context, the takeaway is yours.
// ============================================================

